' Quant-Bot 24/7 auto-start (runs at Windows logon, no admin needed).
' Launches the bot launcher hidden: opens TradingView with CDP, then the bot
' (which analyses + trades on its own) and keeps it alive.
' To disable auto-start, just delete this file from the Startup folder.
Set WshShell = CreateObject("WScript.Shell")
WshShell.Run "powershell.exe -WindowStyle Hidden -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ""D:\Trader Bot\quant-bot\start_24x7.ps1""", 0, False
